{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "vtb-mock — ВТБ SMB E-commerce API (мок-стенд)",
    "version": "0.5.0",
    "description": "Zero-dependency mock adapter for the SMB E-commerce API slice documented in docs/reference/vtb/01-smb-ecommerce-api.md and docs/reference/vtb/02-callbacks-and-testing.md. This is NOT legacy RBS. Business methods are JSON REST at /openapi/smb/efcp/e-commerce/v1/; auth is OAuth 2.0 client_credentials (POST /passport/oauth2/token, form-urlencoded) plus Authorization: Bearer and X-IBM-Client-Id (client_id lowercase, no @ext.vtb.ru) on business calls. amount.value is decimal RUB (10.56), not kopecks. Order statuses CREATED/PAID/REFUNDED/PARTIALLY_REFUNDED/CANCELED and operation statuses NEW/CONFIRMED/RECONCILED each live in their own status.value. Callback is unsigned POST JSON {\"type\":\"PAYMENT|REFUND\",\"object\":{...}} — the payload key quirk (Status for card payments, status for refunds) is preserved as-is; ACK code and retry schedule are not documented publicly, mock-local 2xx/retry policy is a [FORK]."
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "http://localhost:3106",
      "description": "Локальный ВТБ SMB mock"
    }
  ],
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "SMB E-commerce",
      "description": "JSON REST API среза SMB E-commerce интернет-эквайринга ВТБ (не legacy RBS)"
    },
    {
      "name": "OAuth2",
      "description": "Token endpoint client_credentials (RFC 6749)"
    },
    {
      "name": "Hosted pay page",
      "description": "Тестовая страница оплаты по payUrl с синтетическими [FORK]-картами"
    },
    {
      "name": "Mock control",
      "description": "Часы, сценарии, sandbox и административная поверхность мока"
    }
  ],
  "webhooks": {
    "vtbCallback": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "SMB E-commerce"
        ],
        "summary": "Исходящий SMB callback: POST JSON {\"type\",\"object\"} без подписи",
        "description": "The mock posts a JSON envelope {\"type\":\"PAYMENT|REFUND\",\"object\":{...}} to MOCK_VTB_CALLBACK_URL (one URL per resource). Public SMB docs define no callback signature and no ACK code: the mock treats any 2xx as delivered ([FORK], not a protocol claim) and retries on a mock-local schedule (default 3 × 60s). The payment object keeps the documented key quirk Status (card example) while the refund object keeps status (refund example) — no normalization. After a notification reconcile with GET /orders/{orderId} or GET /refunds/{refundId}.",
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/CallbackEnvelope"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "2xx": {
            "description": "Любой 2xx считается доставкой ([FORK]: ACK-код публичным SMB-срезом не зафиксирован)."
          },
          "default": {
            "description": "Не-2xx: повтор по локальному графику мока; SSRF_BLOCKED — терминальный отказ."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "paths": {
    "/passport/oauth2/token": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "OAuth2"
        ],
        "summary": "Выдать access_token (client_credentials)",
        "description": "Form-urlencoded grant_type=client_credentials&client_id=...&client_secret=.... Ответ {access_token, token_type: Bearer, expires_in} (≈170 с по срезу); клиент планирует обновление по expires_in. Заголовки X-IBM-Client-Id и Merchant-Authorization сюда не отправляются.",
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/x-www-form-urlencoded": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                  "grant_type",
                  "client_id",
                  "client_secret"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "grant_type": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "enum": [
                      "client_credentials"
                    ]
                  },
                  "client_id": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "client_secret": {
                    "type": "string"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Токен выдан.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TokenResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "unsupported_grant_type (RFC 6749 §5.2)."
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "invalid_client (RFC 6749 §5.2)."
          },
          "415": {
            "description": "Не form-urlencoded."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/openapi/smb/efcp/e-commerce/v1/orders": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "SMB E-commerce"
        ],
        "summary": "Создать ордер (уникальный merchant orderId)",
        "description": "Обязательны уникальный orderId, orderName и amount {value, code: \"RUB\"} — value в десятичных рублях. Возвращает ордер с payUrl и expire (tz/мс; дефолт — 20 минут). Повтор того же orderId идемпотентен и возвращает существующий ордер (заголовок X-Mock-Replayed: 1).",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/XMockSandbox"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/XMockScenario"
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "$ref": "#/components/requestBodies/CreateOrderBody"
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/RestResponse"
          },
          "400": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/TransportError"
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/TransportError"
          },
          "415": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/TransportError"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/openapi/smb/efcp/e-commerce/v1/orders/preauth": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "SMB E-commerce"
        ],
        "summary": "Создать ордер с предавторизацией (twoStageParams)",
        "description": "Доступность — отдельное разрешение банка; на стенде управляется MOCK_VTB_PREAUTH. twoStageParams обязателен (форма объекта в публичном срезе не зафиксирована — [VERIFY]).",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/XMockSandbox"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/XMockScenario"
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "$ref": "#/components/requestBodies/CreatePreauthBody"
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/RestResponse"
          },
          "400": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/TransportError"
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/TransportError"
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "preauth_disabled: предавторизация не подключена (MOCK_VTB_PREAUTH)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/openapi/smb/efcp/e-commerce/v1/orders/complete/{orderId}": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "SMB E-commerce"
        ],
        "summary": "Завершить холд (сумма ≤ авторизации)",
        "description": "Передаётся amount {value, code}. Сумма не больше авторизованной; частичное подтверждение поддержано (остаток холда снимается).",
